SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The MIT licence above covers only what the 1.6 port added:

  - the correction to the def: wildness moved from a race property to the
    Wildness stat under statBases
  - the AnimalUncommon trade tag and the biome patches that make the sloth
    obtainable (Biomes_Vanilla.xml, Biomes_Mods.xml)
  - the optional patches for A Dog Said... Animal Prosthetics 2 and
    [XND] Nocturnal Animals (Continued), and the load-order declarations
  - the French translation
  - the tests, the packaging and the documentation
  - the Preview.png and ModIcon.png artwork made for this port

IT DOES NOT COVER THE ORIGINAL MOD. The sloth, its stats, its text and its four
textures are ThatRubishGamer's work, reused here:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2253087891

They never declared a licence for it, so none is granted here and none can be.
It is redistributed under the usual practice for abandoned mods - explicit
credit, a link to the original, and removal on request. This describes the
publication policy; it does not grant a licence to the original work.

If ThatRubishGamer asks for this to be taken down, it comes down.
Immediately, and without discussion.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken and what was changed.
